# Copy to .env.local for a build-time override.
#
# In dev, requests go to /api and Vite proxies them to VITE_BACKEND_URL (see
# vite.config.ts) so the browser never needs CORS from the backend.
#
# For a production build (`npm run build && npm run preview`, or any static
# host), there is no dev-server proxy, so the app calls VITE_API_BASE_URL
# directly. Point it at a backend that is reachable and — since this frontend
# runs on a different origin — has CORS enabled for that origin, or is served
# from behind the same reverse proxy as this app.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
